  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat and saute the onion until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the Thai red curry paste and cook for 1 minute until the paste is fragrant.",
    "Add the coconut milk and fish free sauce and stir well to combine.",
    "Add the egg plants and cook until they are tender and the sauce has thickened.",
    "Make 2 wells in the sauce and crack an egg into each well.",
    "Cover the pan and cook until the eggs are cooked to your desired doneness.",
    "Season the curry with salt and sugar to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh basil and serve hot over rice or noodles."
